# ============================================================
# CornUi Project Rules
# Cline AI Development Context
# ============================================================


# PROJECT IDENTITY

Project Name:
CornUi

Type:
Roblox Luau UI Library

Current Version:
2.0.0

Previous Stable Version:
1.9.3

Developer:
Ohiocteator22

Purpose:
A modular, mobile-first Roblox UI framework designed for
loadstring execution, exploit environments, and normal Roblox
ModuleScript usage.

CornUi is inspired by:
- Orion UI
- Fluent UI
- Modern Roblox UI libraries

However, CornUi is its own independent framework.


# ============================================================
# CORE ARCHITECTURE
# ============================================================


Main source directory:

Source/


Structure:


Source/
│
├── init.lua
│
├── Core/
│   │
│   ├── Library.lua
│   ├── Config.lua
