============================================================
DEBUGGING APPROACH
============================================================
When fixing bugs:
Check require paths
Check module return values
Check circular dependencies
Check Library registry
Check State registration
Check ThemeManager references
Do not immediately rewrite.
============================================================
FINAL RULE
============================================================
CornUi is a long-term framework.
Prefer:
stable > clever
modular > short
compatible > rewritten
clean architecture > quick hacks
Always preserve CornUi identity.

